    "text": "Let P be the point on the parabola <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></math> which is at the shortest distance from the center S of the circle <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>64</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo></math> Let Q be the point on the circle dividing the line segment SP internally. Then -",
